		"viz_narr_inventory": {
			"type": "splunk.markdown",
			"options": {
				"markdown": "Centralized view of **all Cisco network assets** discovered across Catalyst Center, Meraki, and other management platforms. Use this tab to verify device coverage, spot missing serial numbers, and drill into the inventory by type, source, or location.",
				"backgroundColor": "#131a23",
				"fontColor": "#ecf0f5"
			}
		},
		"viz_narr_gaps": {
			"type": "splunk.markdown",
			"options": {
				"markdown": "Identifies **devices in inventory that are not sending data** to Splunk — helping you close visibility gaps before they become blind spots. The firewall section highlights missing ASA, FTD, and Firepower data sources.",
				"backgroundColor": "#131a23",
				"fontColor": "#ecf0f5"
			}
		},
		"viz_about_purpose": {
			"type": "splunk.markdown",
			"options": {
				"markdown": "## Asset Inventory & Coverage Dashboard\n\nThis dashboard provides a **consolidated view of all Cisco network assets** discovered across management platforms (Catalyst Center, Meraki Dashboard, and other sources), along with a **data coverage gap analysis** that identifies devices not actively sending telemetry or log data to Splunk.\n\n**Audience:** Network operations, security operations, IT asset management\n\n**Data Sources:** asset_inventory lookup (generated from Catalyst Center, Meraki, and other management APIs), Cisco syslog/NetFlow data in Splunk indexes\n\n**Refresh:** Data updates when the inventory lookup is refreshed (nightly at 02:05 AM); coverage gaps are evaluated against the selected time range\n\n---\n\n### Tab Guide\n\n**Asset Inventory** — Browse and filter the full device inventory by type, management source, and device family. View breakdowns by location and platform.\n\n**Data Coverage Gaps** — Identify devices that exist in inventory but are not sending any data to Splunk. Includes a dedicated firewall coverage section for ASA/FTD/Firepower devices.\n\n**About** — This page. Metric reference, data sources, and troubleshooting.",
				"backgroundColor": "#131a23",
				"fontColor": "#ecf0f5"
			}
		},
		"viz_about_sources": {
			"type": "splunk.markdown",
			"options": {
				"markdown": "### Data Sources & Troubleshooting\n\n**Primary Lookup:** asset_inventory — consolidated from Catalyst Center device health, Meraki device inventory, and other management platform APIs. Refreshed nightly at 02:05 AM.\n\n**Coverage Evaluation:** Searches Splunk indexes for matching device events to determine whether each inventory device is actively sending data.\n\n**Firewall Detection:** Pattern-matches device family against ASA, FTD, and Firepower strings to build the dedicated firewall coverage analysis.\n\n---\n\n**No devices appearing?**\nVerify the asset_inventory lookup exists and is populated. Run: | inputlookup asset_inventory | stats count\n\n**Coverage % seems wrong?**\nCoverage is evaluated over the selected time range. A narrow window may miss devices that report infrequently. Try expanding to 24h or 7d.\n\n**Firewall section empty?**\nThe firewall section filters on device_family matching ASA, FTD, or Firepower. If your inventory uses different naming, the regex may need adjustment.",
				"backgroundColor": "#131a23",
				"fontColor": "#ecf0f5"
			}
		}
	},
	"dataSources": {
		"ds_count_by_family": {
			"name": "Devices by Family",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_inventory_base",
				"query": "| stats count by device_family"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_count_by_location": {
			"name": "Devices by Location",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_inventory_base",
				"query": "| where len(location)>0 \n| stats count by location"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_filtered_count_by_source": {
			"name": "Devices by Management Source",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_inventory_base",
				"query": "| stats count by management_source"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_filtered_count_by_type": {
			"name": "Devices by Type",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_inventory_base",
				"query": "| stats count by device_type"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_firewall_gap": {
			"name": "Firewall Gap Detail",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_gap_analysis",
				"query": "| where match(device_family, \"(?i)ASA|FTD|Firepower\") \n| table device_name, device_family, location, ip_address, management_source, data_status \n| sort data_status, device_name"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_firewall_kpis": {
			"name": "Firewall KPIs Base",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_gap_analysis",
				"query": "| where match(device_family, \"(?i)ASA|FTD|Firepower\") \n| stats count as expected, sum(eval(if(data_status==\"Sending Data\",1,0))) as fw_sending \n| eval gap=expected-fw_sending, ha_pairs=round(fw_sending/2, 2), gap_pct=if(expected>0, round(gap/expected*100,1), 0) \n| fields fw_sending, expected, gap, ha_pairs, gap_pct"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_fw_kpi_expected": {
			"name": "FW Expected",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_firewall_kpis",
				"query": "| fields expected"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_fw_kpi_gap": {
			"name": "FW Missing",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_firewall_kpis",
				"query": "| fields gap"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_fw_kpi_pairs": {
			"name": "HA Pairs Detected",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_firewall_kpis",
				"query": "| fields ha_pairs"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_fw_kpi_sending": {
			"name": "FW Sending Data",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_firewall_kpis",
				"query": "| fields fw_sending"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_gap_analysis": {
			"name": "Asset Inventory - Gap Analysis",
			"options": {
				"query": "| inputlookup asset_inventory\n| eval short_name=device_name_short, ip=ip_address\n| append\n[| search `index_catalyst` sourcetype=\"cisco:dnac:devicehealth\"\n| stats count by DeviceName, IpAddress\n| eval splunk_host=lower(DeviceName),\nsplunk_short=lower(mvindex(split(DeviceName,\".\"),0)),\nsplunk_ip=IpAddress, has_data=1\n| fields splunk_host, splunk_short, splunk_ip, has_data]\n| append\n[| search `index_network` sourcetype=\"cisco:ios\"\n| stats count by host\n| eval splunk_host=lower(host),\nsplunk_short=lower(mvindex(split(host,\".\"),0)),\nhas_data=1\n| fields splunk_host, splunk_short, has_data]\n| append\n[| tstats `scd_summariesonly` count from datamodel=Network_Traffic by All_Traffic.dvc\n| rename \"All_Traffic.dvc\" as dvc\n| eval splunk_host=lower(dvc),\nsplunk_short=lower(mvindex(split(dvc,\".\"),0)),\nhas_data=1\n| where isnotnull(splunk_host) AND splunk_host!=\"\"\nAND NOT match(splunk_host, \"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-\")\n| fields splunk_host, splunk_short, has_data]\n| append\n[| search `index_identity` sourcetype=\"cisco:ise:syslog\"\n| rex \"NetworkDeviceName=(?<nad_name>[^,]+)\"\n| where isnotnull(nad_name) AND nad_name!=\"DefaultNetworkDevice\"\n| stats count by nad_name\n| eval splunk_host=lower(nad_name),\nsplunk_short=lower(mvindex(split(nad_name,\".\"),0)),\nhas_data=1\n| fields splunk_host, splunk_short, has_data]\n| append\n[| search `index_windows` (sourcetype=\"*WinEventLog\" OR sourcetype=\"ActiveDirectory\" OR sourcetype=\"MSAD:NT6:DNS\")\n| stats count by host\n| eval splunk_host=lower(host),\nsplunk_short=lower(mvindex(split(host,\".\"),0)),\nhas_data=1\n| fields splunk_host, splunk_short, has_data]\n| append\n[| search `index_dhcp` sourcetype=\"DhcpSrvLog\"\n| stats count by host\n| eval splunk_host=lower(host),\nsplunk_short=lower(mvindex(split(host,\".\"),0)),\nhas_data=1\n| fields splunk_host, splunk_short, has_data]\n| eventstats values(eval(if(has_data==1, splunk_host, null()))) as all_splunk_hosts,\nvalues(eval(if(has_data==1, splunk_short, null()))) as all_splunk_shorts,\nvalues(eval(if(has_data==1, splunk_ip, null()))) as all_splunk_ips\n| where isnotnull(device_name)\n| eval matched=if(\n(short_name IN (all_splunk_hosts))\nOR (short_name IN (all_splunk_shorts))\nOR (ip IN (all_splunk_ips))\nOR (ip IN (all_splunk_hosts))\nOR (lower(device_name) IN (all_splunk_hosts))\nOR (lower(device_name) IN (all_splunk_shorts))\n, 1, 0)\n| eval data_status=if(matched==1, \"Sending Data\", \"NO DATA\")\n| table device_name, device_family, device_role, platform_id, location, ip_address, health_score, management_source, data_status\n| sort data_status, device_family, location, device_name",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$time_tok.earliest$",
					"latest": "$time_tok.latest$"
				}
			},
			"type": "ds.search"
		},
		"ds_gap_kpi_nodata": {
			"name": "No Data",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_gap_kpis",
				"query": "| fields no_data"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_gap_kpi_pct": {
			"name": "Coverage",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_gap_kpis",
				"query": "| fields coverage_pct"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_gap_kpi_sending": {
			"name": "Sending Data",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_gap_kpis",
				"query": "| fields sending"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_gap_kpi_total": {
			"name": "Gap Total Devices",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_gap_kpis",
				"query": "| fields total"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_gap_kpis": {
			"name": "Gap KPIs Base",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_gap_analysis",
				"query": "| stats count as total, sum(eval(if(data_status==\"Sending Data\",1,0))) as sending \n| eval no_data=total-sending, coverage_pct=round(sending/total*100,1) \n| fields total, sending, no_data, coverage_pct"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_gap_no_data": {
			"name": "Devices NOT Sending Data",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_gap_analysis",
				"query": "| where data_status=\"NO DATA\" \n| table device_name, device_family, device_role, platform_id, location, ip_address, management_source, health_score"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_gap_summary": {
			"name": "Gap Summary by Family",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_gap_analysis",
				"query": "| stats count by device_family, data_status \n| rename data_status as status"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_inventory_base": {
			"name": "Inventory Base",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_lookup_base",
				"query": "| eval _filter_type=if(\"$filter_type$\"=\"*\",1,if(like(\"$filter_type$\",\"%\".device_type.\"%\"),1,0)), _filter_src=if(\"$filter_source$\"=\"*\",1,if(like(\"$filter_source$\",\"%\".management_source.\"%\") OR like(management_source,\"%\".\"$filter_source$\".\"%\"),1,0)) \n| where _filter_type=1 AND _filter_src=1 \n| fields - _filter_type _filter_src"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_inventory_table": {
			"name": "Full Inventory",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_inventory_base",
				"query": "| sort device_type device_name \n| rename device_name as \"Device Name\", device_name_short as \"Short Name\", device_type as \"Type\", device_family as \"Family\", platform_id as \"Platform\", ip_address as \"IP Address\", mac_address as \"MAC Address\", software_version as \"Software\", serial_number as \"Serial\", location as \"Location\", device_role as \"Role\", device_series as \"Series\", health_score as \"Health\", compliance_status as \"Compliance\", management_source as \"Source\", last_seen as \"Last Seen\""
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_last_refresh": {
			"name": "Last Lookup Refresh",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_lookup_base",
				"query": "| stats max(last_seen) as last_refresh"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_lookup_base": {
			"name": "Lookup Base",
			"options": {
				"query": "| inputlookup asset_inventory\n| fields device_name, device_name_short, device_type, device_family, device_role, device_series, platform_id, ip_address, mac_address, software_version, serial_number, location, health_score, compliance_status, management_source, last_seen",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$time_tok.earliest$",
					"latest": "$time_tok.latest$"
				}
			},
			"type": "ds.search"
		},
		"ds_total_devices": {
			"name": "Total Devices",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_lookup_base",
				"query": "| stats count as total"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_total_with_ip": {
			"name": "Known IP Addresses",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_lookup_base",
				"query": "| where len(ip_address)>0 \n| stats count as total"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_total_with_serial": {
			"name": "Known Serials",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_lookup_base",
				"query": "| where len(serial_number)>0 \n| stats count as total"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		}
	},
